>**Raises nation's Prosperity, Resources and Supplies at the cost of Supplies.**
=2 Walkthrough
+ You must aquire 4000 EXP/Limit points through defensive {p:Campaign Battles|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Campaign_Battles}. This may be done in any amount of battles needed to aquire the said amount, and does not require you to finish the battle.
+ After the battle, have your performance assessed by the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} at the fortification in the area. (*Not required to complete ops)
+ Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* As the type of operation is Defensive, you must participate in defensive battles, i.e., battles in zones controlled by Windurst.
* You still get the EXP/Limit Points and Allied Notes from Campaign as well as the reward from the Campaign Op.
* This mission can be completed regardless of zoning, time taken, or otherwise. So as long as you assess the required experience in one or more campaign battles.
* A notice saying you have completed the mission will appear in the message window with Experience and {p:Allied Notes} upon satisfactory completion of the objectives.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
